      "id": "IronIsland_Text_ImRileyHeresAGift",
      "en_US": [
        "...You are?\r",
        "OK, you’re {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "I’m Riley.\r",
        "I’m a Trainer, and yes, it is a bit\n",
        "odd that I would be training here.\r",
        "Anyway, it’s always nice to meet\n",
        "another Trainer. Here’s a gift.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "IronIsland_Text_YouCanJoinMeInside",
      "en_US": [
        "Riley: That Hidden Machine contains\n",
        "the move Strength.\r",
        "To use it out of battle, you need the\n",
        "Badge from Canalave Gym...\r",
        "Oh, never mind, you’ve already got the\n",
        "Mine Badge. My bad.\r",
        "I’ll be training inside.\n",
        "You can join me if you’d like.\r"
      ]
    },
